  "body": "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy should be enforced during redirects, as verified by this web platform test:\nhttps://wpt.fyi/results/html/cross-origin-opener-policy/coep-redirect.https.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned&view=subtest&q=cross-origin-opener-policy\n\nThe current navigation algorithm uses a filtered response's header list in case of a redirect, which is nulled. It should use the internal value instead.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/67994b2...f592a74/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/67994b2...f592a74/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8686/67994b2...f592a74/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 17, 2023, 9:54 AM UTC (f592a74)\">diff</a> )",
